        "benefits": [
          {
            "number": 1,
            "titleZh": "談論移走物品及整理地方",
            "titleEn": "Talk about making a place free and tidy",
            "zh": "clear away、clear something out 和 clear up 可以幫助你描述收走物品、清空地方，以及在活動後收拾環境。",
            "en": "Clear away, clear something out and clear up help you describe removing things, emptying spaces and tidying after an activity.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 2,
            "titleZh": "描述不同的離開方式",
            "titleEn": "Describe different ways of leaving a place",
            "zh": "clear off 可以叫人走開；clear out 可以表示某人完全離開一個地方；clear somebody away 則表示使其他人離開。",
            "en": "Clear off can tell someone to go away. Clear out can show that someone leaves a place completely, while clear somebody away describes making other people leave.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 3,
            "titleZh": "談論疑問或誤會得到解決",
            "titleEn": "Talk about problems becoming clear",
            "zh": "當訊息、解釋或對話解決問題或消除疑惑時，可以使用 clear something up。",
            "en": "Clear something up is useful when a message, explanation or conversation solves a problem or removes confusion.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 4,
            "titleZh": "描述天氣好轉",
            "titleEn": "Describe a change in the weather",
            "zh": "clear up 可以自然地表示雨停了，而天氣亦開始轉好。",
            "en": "Clear up provides a natural way to say that the rain has stopped and the weather has become better.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          }
        ],
