        "benefits": [
          {
            "number": 1,
            "titleZh": "準確說明進行了哪一種清潔",
            "titleEn": "Say exactly what kind of cleaning happened",
            "zh": "CLEAN 片語動詞可以說明你是替某人清洗、清洗整個表面、清除污漬、清理內部，還是收拾混亂。",
            "en": "CLEAN expressions can show whether you washed a person, cleaned a whole surface, removed a mark, cleaned inside something or cleared a mess.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 2,
            "titleZh": "談論如何整頓地方，使它更安全",
            "titleEn": "Talk about making places safer and better",
            "zh": "clean up 可以描述整頓城鎮、市場、街道或機構，清除問題和不誠實行為。",
            "en": "Clean up can describe improving a town, market, street or organisation by removing problems and dishonest behaviour.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 3,
            "titleZh": "理解與金錢和成功有關的強烈意思",
            "titleEn": "Understand strong meanings about money and success",
            "zh": "clean somebody out 表示令某人身無分文；clean up 也可以表示贏得很多獎項或賺取很多錢。",
            "en": "Clean somebody out means leaving someone with no money. Clean up can also mean winning many awards or making a lot of money.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          },
          {
            "number": 4,
            "titleZh": "清楚給予日常清潔指示",
            "titleEn": "Give clear everyday instructions",
            "zh": "在家中、學校或工作場所，你可以使用 clean the table down、clean the mud off、clean the cupboard out 和 clean the room up 等表達。",
            "en": "You can use expressions such as clean the table down, clean the mud off, clean the cupboard out and clean the room up at home, school or work.",
            "sourcePage": 3
          }
        ],
