            "number": 3,
            "titleZh": "自然談論頭髮和外表",
            "titleEn": "Talk naturally about hair and appearance",
            "zh": "grow back、grow out 和 grow something out 可用來談論剪髮、染髮和鬍鬚。",
            "en": "Grow back, grow out and grow something out are useful for talking about haircuts, hair colour and beards.",
